   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definitional Mission - GROUNDWATER AND SOIL REMEDIATION SECTOR OPPORTUNITIES, through Ascendant Program Services, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $45,000 Definitional Mission evaluates water and soil sector opportunities in China for USTDA funding consideration. China&apos;s Ministry of Environmental Protection (MEP) requested USTDA assistance with groundwater quality activities to support implementation of the country&apos;s groundwater quality master plan with recognition of U.S. experience and leadership in this sector.</narrative>
